      "relevant_sections": "Abstract; §II problem formulation, theorem1; OAS derivation",
      "established_mechanism_zh": "针对独立同分布Gaussian样本估计协方差，提出RBLW与oracle-approximating shrinkage (OAS)，在样本协方差与缩放identity之间选择收缩。RBLW对LW的MSE优势依赖Gaussian设定；OAS是对未知oracle的近似。",
